hub.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1pt/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop the fenced Referenced By loop and carry prompt citations [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]as link events[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]refby-events[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refby-events: check the link-v2 fence before the lock, pull, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot, emit prompt cites rows as publishable link events in fenced [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]projects, make referenced-by failures charge attempts, and handle the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existing queued backlog.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Truthful commit-stage timing[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]measure[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]measure: emit stitch op_started before the subprocess runs and add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-substep publication timing on the finalizer step channel.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Move artifact retention off the per-run tail[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]retention[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retention: run enforce_artifact_retention from an hourly housekeeping [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]job and keep only a throttled inline fallback in the runner's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exec-finalize tail.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Resolve revision-pin rebase conflicts mechanically[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pin-resolver[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pin-resolver: add a revision-pin resolver to the semantic rebase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]conflict chain that takes the descendant SHA when ancestry proves it, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]falling back to model repair otherwise.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make queued prompt-archive publication equivalent and [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]protected[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]deferred-parity[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refby-events[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]deferred-parity: record the commit context on outbox rows, render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deferred prompt archives exactly like the synchronous path including its[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]side effects, and stop pruning pool files that a pending request still [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]needs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Host-owned background publication job[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]publisher[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refby-events[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]publisher: add a doorbell-triggered scheduler job that drains agent-hood[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]requests, hinted link-outbox agents, and unfenced referenced-by requests[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]under the existing lock, plus a heartbeat and a real drain bound in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]secret scanner.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End the commit stage at the durable enqueue[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]enqueue-only[dim] · [dim][/dim]after measure, deferred-parity, publisher[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]enqueue-only: replace the commit path's prompt-archive publish and both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]drains with a durable enqueue plus publisher hints, ring the doorbell [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after done.json, and keep the inline path as a config- and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]liveness-gated fallback.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove latency and sidecar reliability on athena[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]prove[dim] · [dim][/dim]after retention, pin-resolver, enqueue-only[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]prove: after the installed sase includes the epic, measure commit-stage [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]latency against the baseline and audit every sampled run's sidecar [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]obligations end to end.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1pt","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1pt.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d7e19e28cf216999bfa16f4818dc5d4a","started_at":"2026-10-29T22:16:08.532837+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"3c51c0a101b1dcb09369624963bee0bc061d3992777a714130cd294afe5a668e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1pt.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"b9bee72f1b5bceb253f0b2b899deb568dcfd221fd5eddeb74d5fdb35386cfed3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1pt.land/meta.json","size_bytes":720},"prompt":{"digest":"ae02fdf8fe1c8058023bfcf4d0deccf9895b26beacd98f4f2a79fe4c1ec244b8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1pt.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":373},"state":{"digest":"4278403a2fb486f66cc8ef16c8408a3d159317d5346fdf598554b832b949e649","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1pt.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-1pt.land","local_name":"sase-1pt.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-1pt","agent_clan_generation":"20261029181311","bead_id":"sase-1pt","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tri